title the fever-reader
fits stage=adult|old
prefers role=merchant job=healer temper=short
traits temper=short talk=quiet warmth=reserved humour=none honesty=plain piety=ordinary drive=content
quirk knows_the_flood_streets_by_the_fevers_after
likes roast_pork singing fresh_straw warm_rain
dislikes haggling wet_floors
